silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_phase2_substrate_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '01Phase2SubstrateYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 01_phase2_substrate, the ] [d, arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens.; also, In the Music graph engine entry section 01_phase2_substrate, the ]\\\\ |[constraintnode]| ValidationResult [r, arrow witnesses the DomesticCat classification arrow as a typed source leg into D_Mittens — NOT an identity onto Mittens." .
